Assembly Toolbox

##
This is a block comment: everything until the closing marker is ignored,
even things that look like keys:
Compiler.Defines SHOULD_NOT_EXIST=1
##

# Long values can be split into a block instead of one huge line:
SourceFiles
{
    main
    helper
}

# A { } block after a key nests everything under that namespace - these two
# lines are identical to writing Linker.Subsystem and Linker.Stack:
Linker
{
    Subsystem Console
    Stack     4194304
}

# Values normally ACCUMULATE: a second Compiler.Defines line adds to the
# first. A backtick after the key REPLACES instead:
Compiler.Defines  FIRST_TRY=1
Compiler.Defines` FINAL_ONLY=1
